{"title":"Mannequin","slug":"Mannequin","pageid":2564,"revid":17358,"timestamp":"2025-02-23T01:00:27Z","lastEditor":"Oaklandsman","categories":["Decorative_Item"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"All of them"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Oak Depot, The Lighthouse, Mike's Mines, Fungi Finds, Illumine Designs, Radical Shack and Alan's AutoLogistics"},{"label":"Price","value":"$250"},{"label":"Function","value":"Decoration"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.53.MANNEQUIN"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"variants","text":"Variants"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote><p><i><big>\"A very friendly yet ominous wooden figure... It's like it's always watching? Planning...?\"</big></i></p></blockquote>\n\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The <b>Mannequin</b> was added on April Fools 2024 to  <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Oak_Depot/\">Oak Depot</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lighthouse/\">The Lighthouse</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Mike's_Mines/\">Mike's Mines</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Fungi_Finds/\">Fungi Finds</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Illumine_Designs/\">Illumine Designs</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Radical_Shack/\">Radical Shack</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Alan's_AutoLogistics/\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a>. It can be found scattered all over the shops and you can buy the Mannequins for $250 each.\n</p><p>The <b>Mannequin</b> when bought from the store changes into one of the 20 known variants.\n</p><p>The <b>Mannequin</b>, the rc sellner, and the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Baby_Ducky/\">baby duck</a> are the only items in Oaklands that has this type of physics applied to them! \n</p>\n<h2 id=\"variants\">Variants</h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"774efacdcc9db072c1a195ce6fc97783\" data-seq-no=\"0\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"Owo_mannequin-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" a